{"list_scraping_time": "1640930242", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=telur&updated-max=2012-05-13T19:40:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=54&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2012/02/telur-dadar-dengan-mayonis-yang-gebu.html", "list_item_title": "Telur Mayonis Yang Gebu", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "2/22/2012", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n3\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nLauk Pauk\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640930245", "page_title": "Telur Mayonis Yang Gebu", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "2/22/2012", "page_item_category": ["Lauk Pauk", "Telur"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Telur?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["\n", "Telur dadar dengan mayonis menjadikan telur dadar kita sangat\u00a0gebu dan kekal gebu selamanya. Itu yang membuatkan saya teruja untuk cuba memasak telur dadar dengan mayonis. \u00a0", "Alaa macam Sheila Rusly punya iklan kat TV tu. \u00a0Sedikit sahaja pembaharuan yang dibuat menghasilkan masakan yang sedap dan berlainan dengan telur yang biasa dibuat sebelum ini. Jom cuba...", "Oleh: Azie Kitchen", "Bahan bahan", "2 biji telur", "1 sudu makan mayonis", "2 tangkai daun bawang - hiris", "1 biji cili merah - hiris", "3 ulas bawang merah - hiris", "Garam secukup rasa", "\nCara cara:", "Satukan semua bahan bahan. Kacau rata.\u00a0 Panaskan minyak dalam kuali dan goreng sehingga masak.", "\n", "\n", "Sedap dimakan dengan nasi putih panas panas.\u00a0", "Selamat mencuba ..."], "page_description_image_url": ["https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-n4-ktYgjuSY/T0THK-9v4GI/AAAAAAAAHSY/wH-MFgtrPQk/s640/IMG_5446.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-3iSNHOtiTus/T0THMF5-z5I/AAAAAAAAHSg/1R5e-98lgiY/s640/IMG_5448.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-tApEhDEuL7k/T0THH89AK5I/AAAAAAAAHSI/J6xnCALYnIM/s640/IMG_5439.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-9irH0ocZaFo/T0THJBJKtNI/AAAAAAAAHSQ/fzhPtqTFu-E/s640/IMG_5442.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "3 ulasan", "page_comment": ["Sedap....nanti boleh try", "Sedap dan gebu", "Petua xnak bagi minyak tu berbuih, letak bawang putih.. Goreng dulu.. Kemudian baru masukkan telur kedalam kuali.. Sudah masak, tanggalkan bwag ptih tsebut dri tlur.. Klau xnk tggalkn pon xper.."], "page_comment_time": ["24 Disember, 2012 20:28", "24 Disember, 2012 23:05", "17 Julai, 2014 09:33"], "page_comment_user": ["Azie", "Muhamad Azfar bin Ahmad"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/16649262195990595973"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//resources.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640930242", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=telur&updated-max=2012-05-13T19:40:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=54&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2012/03/sambal-tumis-telur-yang-menggoda.html", "list_item_title": "Sambal Tumis Telur Yang Menggoda", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "3/29/2012", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n34\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nLauk Pauk\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640930246", "page_title": "Sambal Tumis Telur Yang Menggoda", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "3/29/2012", "page_item_category": ["Lauk Pauk", "Telur"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Telur?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Hmmm semuanya gara gara Sambal Tumis Telur ini\u00a0 menyebabkan saya makan banyak malam ni, nasi lemak lagi... Camne nak citer pasal diet bagai?\u00a0", "Asalnya saya terbaca dalam blog Kkida pasal jenis jenis cili kering, aduhai dalam tu diselit pulak gambar gambar sambal tumis udang, sambal tumis telur yang gambar nya nampak sangat menyelerakan. Ada berani nak buat azam nak diet lagi? Atau makan jer lah apa rasa nak makan sementara masih boleh makan.\u00a0", "Memang saya bermasalah sekarang ini, masalah tak boleh mengawal selera, masalah tengah seronok nak memasak dan masalah seronok melawat lawat dapur rumah orang. OK dah tak mahu citer lagi lah, sendiri mahu ingat lah, Azie. Nak pergi US bulan depan ni rasanya baju semua dah tak muat, kalau tak mahu berubah kena lah beli baju baru.", "\u00a0", "Jom layan resepi sebab lepas ni nak dengar kuliah Ustaz Kazim nak cari ketenangan diri, nak bermuhasabah diri sekali. Hidup untuk makan atau makan untuk hidup?", "Oleh: ", "Bahan bahan\u00a0", "5 biji bawang merah\u00a0", "3 ulas bawang putih\u00a0", "1 biji bawang besar - hiris\u00a0", "4 sudu besar cili kering kisar\u00a0", "Sedikit belacan\u00a0", "Garam\u00a0", "Gula\u00a0", "Air asam jawa\u00a0", "Telur - rebus, kupas & goreng\u00a0", "Cara cara:\u00a0", "Panaskan minyak. Tumis bawang merah dan bawang putih yang dimesin sehingga garing dan wangi. ", "Masukkan cili kisar dan goreng dengan \napi perlahan sehingga betul betul garing. Masukkan gula terlebih dahulu \nsupaya sambal berwarna merah cantik.\u00a0", "Masukkan garam, belacan dan air asam jawa. Kalau terlalu pekat, \ntambahkan air sedikit demi sedikit.\u00a0", "Kemudian masukkan bawang besar yang dihiris.\n\nAkhir sekali masukkan telur rebus yang telah digoreng. Sesuaikan rasa dan kepekatan.\u00a0", "Angkat dan hidangkan panas panas dengan nasi lemak atau nasi putih atau nasi minyak."], "page_description_image_url": ["https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-7CnMQsuXWzY/T3RvQdf6xbI/AAAAAAAAI_c/2sdPVShAzVg/s640/IMG_9315.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-ihb-6N_zmCM/T3RvTq3qcWI/AAAAAAAAI_s/ATU5GOQxbhY/s640/IMG_9367.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-7CnMQsuXWzY/T3RvQdf6xbI/AAAAAAAAI_c/2sdPVShAzVg/s640/IMG_9315.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-0CtK0QxJFBc/T3RvKeqywVI/AAAAAAAAI-8/KCYhaVgKank/s640/IMG_9270.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-7RBUfpoYr2E/T3RvMCaxzOI/AAAAAAAAI_A/KGmzUbJMACg/s640/IMG_9278.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-PzR2VyjKAXc/T3RvNYOC1eI/AAAAAAAAI_M/QeEsPAcexmM/s640/IMG_9281.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-lruVatveX38/T3RvO2XAvXI/AAAAAAAAI_U/HEGKFpkSbgk/s640/IMG_9283.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-aOOjaCv53JI/T3RvR0lwrNI/AAAAAAAAI_k/Gqo6XPyGwv8/s640/IMG_9363.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "34 ulasan", "page_comment": ["salam Zie apa kabar?? takde gambar sambal nye ke Zie mesti ngancam ni kan", "Noor, baru jer upload gambar gambarnya. Tengah sedih ni Noor sebab dah termakan banyak malam ni semua dek sambal tumis telur nih", "Sedapnyer..meleleh air liur tgk foto ni Zie..", "sedapnyaaa", "Haluuuuuuu. ...........", "Lahaulawala sdapnyer.........yes!!!!", "Hi azie.. Sedap memang sedap. Saya pompuan cina Dari Malaysia duduk Kat canada. Rinduuuu segala makanan warung... Saya dah try recipe Kari Ikan (makan dengan roti canai frozen) & sambal telur... Memang sedap! Thank you!!", "Hi Jen, gembira jika blog ini dpt membantu Jen di Kanads", "Sedapnyerrr....nak buat lah jugak..", "Sdpnyer..nk try msk time bbka nti.", "Nampak sedapnya...semalam nak buat tapi tak jadi pulak..hihi..:)", "Nampak sgt sedap.. Dah try tadi... Nyumss.. Tq kak azie! ", "Terima kasih.. Membantu sy masak utk adik sbb ibu x sehat :) ", " Sedapnye... nk try masak la jugak...", "Nk masak jgk la", "Sy da try wat byk kli da mmg sedap.sy bkn kate telur. Ikan pun sy pkai resepi ni. Thanks 4 d resepi", "Saya selalu guna resepi dari blog akak. Semua sedap2 hihi. Tq utk segala perkongsian.-Maisara-", "Salam sis... klu x ad cili kisar... nak ganti ngan ap ye? Maaf ... sya bru nak belajar masak :)", "Boleh guna cili kering, rebus dan kisar.. Kalau tak ada juga, bolelah guna cili merah hidup", "Saya buat tak jadi sebab kurang minyak \ud83d\ude2d", "Sedapnya...", "Salam kak zie..sy selalu follow resepi akak...mmg best resepi2 akak...", "Sy da try & mmg sedap \ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udffc, bahan2 pun senang nk dpt.  thanks for sharing sis ", "Assalammualaikum Kak Zie, saya dah buat semalam sejurus selepas saya terjumpa resepi sambal telur akak. Memang tak rugi saya try, sedap sangat! Lepas ni boleh try buat nasi lemak. Thank you kak!", "mmg sedapla kak sy dh try mmg marvelous", "Xde air asam jawa xpe ke?huhu", "KLau tak ada air asam jawa, gantikan dg asam keping atau kisar 1 biji tomato buah", "Tak letak belacan boleh tak kak azie ? ", "Salam kak Azie sy slalu skodeng resepi akk..klu nk msak msti cari resepi kt blog akk..", "Assalamualaikum, I'm not a big fan of cooking but satu hari ttiba terdetik dkt hati ni utk try masak... So,saya google for resepi2 yg senang utk dimasak and trust me, your recipies are my favourite... Byk yg saya belajar through out your blog... Thank you so much sbb byk kongsi resepi.. And Selamat Hari Guru bcos u're my cooking teacher now", "Sejak kahwin,blog ni banyak membantu saya dalam sediakan makanan&juadah open house", "i love ur blog sis. ", "Dah cuba dan menjadi..tq kak azie share resepi..", "Izinkan saya copy resepi akak ya..tq..", "Salam Kak Azie..Mcmana goreng telur dia jd kuning penuh gitu? Goreng minyak byk me skit?", "Wah.. Boleh try ni."], "page_comment_time": ["29 Mac, 2012 21:30", "29 Mac, 2012 22:36", "09 April, 2014 11:31", "10 Jun, 2014 10:50", "02 Julai, 2014 19:01", "04 November, 2014 07:32", "04 November, 2014 07:58", "17 November, 2014 08:45", "23 Jun, 2015 13:52", "14 Ogos, 2015 09:41", "18 Ogos, 2015 17:29", "22 September, 2015 12:39", "01 November, 2015 10:21", "24 Januari, 2016 18:17", "04 April, 2016 17:07", "13 Mei, 2016 14:13", "28 Mei, 2016 13:20", "29 Mei, 2016 02:43", "16 Jun, 2016 19:04", "21 Jun, 2016 15:27", "01 Julai, 2016 17:53", "06 Julai, 2016 23:59", "11 Ogos, 2016 10:49", "19 September, 2016 20:05", "02 Oktober, 2016 11:25", "02 Oktober, 2016 12:33", "09 Disember, 2016 23:37", "10 Mac, 2017 16:47", "24 Mei, 2017 01:53", "11 Julai, 2017 13:55", "20 Julai, 2017 14:24", "22 September, 2017 18:23", "05 April, 2018 13:06", "21 Jun, 2018 10:48"], "page_comment_user": ["Unknown", "Azie", "fiez sofea", "Farhana", "jit_tontoya", "Unknown", "Azie", "Unknown", "Unknown", "The Street Walk of Life", "farah", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Unknown", "AshleySya", "Azie", "Unknown", "Cik Zu Official", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Diah Ngasri", "Unknown", "Azie", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Unknown", "anis azhar", "rafydaabdgahni", "Unknown", "itz_milkywhale", "Fatynz Hatanan"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/168329